@startuml
title Idempotency V1.1 - L3 SHORT_TERM 窗口与物理保留

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state "Generation N\nwindow active" as ACTIVE
state "Semantic Window Expired\n不再阻止新执行" as WINDOW_EXPIRED
state "Retention Only\n旧物理记录可能仍存在" as RETENTION
state "Generation N+1\n新 PROCESSING" as NEXT
state "Redis Key Removed" as REMOVED

[*] --> ACTIVE : first acquire\nwindowExpireAt = now + window
ACTIVE --> WINDOW_EXPIRED : now >= windowExpireAt
WINDOW_EXPIRED --> RETENTION : recordRetentionTtl > 0
WINDOW_EXPIRED --> REMOVED : retention=0
RETENTION --> NEXT : 新请求到达\n原子 rollover\nversion + 1
RETENTION --> REMOVED : now >= retentionExpireAt
WINDOW_EXPIRED --> NEXT : 新请求先于物理清理

note right of ACTIVE
FIXED：windowExpireAt 不动。
SLIDING：有效访问把 windowExpireAt
推进到 now + idempotencyWindow。
end note

note right of RETENTION
Retention 只为排障/观测。
不继续提供幂等阻断语义。
end note

@enduml
